# **Drum and Dance Intensive in Woodford**

Hi all, Well the next Drum and Dance event has been set in for August 10th in Woodford! We have some very special students in Woodford that we think will appreciate this one!! Nathaniel will be running a 1.5 hour drumming workshop and then we have the fabulous Yenenesh teaching a 1.5hr dance intensive! Its going to hot, sweaty and fantastic! So, reserve your places because this is one not to be missed! 10-11.30 African Drumming 11.30-1pm African Dancing $30 each or $50 both Woodford Open Space 126 Archer St, Woodford See you there! Ph 0434585992 or email info@rhythmculture.com.au
